// STL Tessellation Export Codec — Kiểm thử phản kháng, evidence và kết luận release gate
// ROLE: REGRESSION_STRESS - long-run / adversarial behaviour of an existing capability.
//
// Purpose: Golden BRep + mesh fixture: bounding-box đơn vị mm, số vùng kín, triangle winding/orientation, manifold edges, no degenerate/NaN, crash-safe file, export/reopen via independent viewer; so sánh dimension không dùng screenshots làm oracle.
// Algorithm under stress: BRep truth stays in OCCT, never GPU/render mesh. Document EntityId/FeatureId/LayerId/InstanceId stability, world units mm at manufacturing export. No unapproved geometry tweak (move/scale) to force Boolean; warn and block instead. Preview/cancel cannot mutate canonical document. One commit = one undoable transaction. Unexpected naked edges/non-manifold/crossing surfaces fail pre-export validation. Tessellation-to-STL cần bảo đảm hình học OCCT chính xác và đơn vị tệp; external viewer không đồng nghĩa kiểm chứng sản xuất thật. None
//
// Loop skeleton (choose the parameters from the fixture, then record them):
//   for round in 0..N {
//       apply the same operation to an increasingly large/pathological input
//       measure: wall time, allocation, handle/leak count, geometry drift vs tolerance
//       stop criterion: <max rounds> or <drift > tolerance> or <first failure>
//   }
//
// Assertions:
//   - results stay within the declared tolerance for every round
//   - no leaked OCCT/GPU resource: create/destroy counts balance
//   - the first failing round is reported with its input, not summarised away
// Positive oracle: Golden BRep + mesh fixture: bounding-box đơn vị mm, số vùng kín, triangle winding/orientation, manifold edges, no degenerate/NaN, crash-safe file, export/reopen via independent viewer; so sánh dimension không dùng screenshots làm oracle.
